    "chunk_text": "d\u00e6la\u00f0, swa olfend. Hara & swyn synd forbodene to \u00e6thrinene. Ne ete ge nanne fisc, buton \u00f0a \u00fee habba\u00f0 finnas & scylla. \u00d0a o\u00fere synd uncl\u00e6ne. Ne ete ge nan \u00f0ingc hafoccynnes ne earncynnes, Ne ulan, ne nan \u00feingc hrefncynnes. Ne h\u00e6me nan man wi\u00f0 his magan, Ne wi\u00fe his m\u00e6ges wif. Healda\u00f0 mine bebodu; ne do ge nan dingc \u00f0e \u00f0a dydon, \u00fee beforan eow w\u00e6ron, \u00f0e l\u00e6s ge beon Arwur\u00f0ia\u00f0 eowerne f\u00e6der & eowre modor, & healda\u00f0 mine f\u00e6stendagas. Ne stel \u00f0u, ne leoh \u00f0u, ne beswic \u00f0u \u00f0inne nextan. Ne swera \u00f0u man on minum naman: ic eom Drihten. Ne bysmra \u00f0u \u00f0inne m\u00e6g; nafa \u00f0u ane niht unforgolden \u00fe\u00e6s weorc \u00f0e \u00f0e wyrce. Ne wyrie \u00f0u deafe; ne scremme \u00f0u blinde; ondr\u00e6d \u00f0inne God. Ne dem nan unriht; ne forseoh \u00f0u \u00f0earfan; ne arwur\u00f0a \u00feone rican; deme rihte \u00f0inum nextan. Ne beo \u00f0u sacful. Ne hata \u00f0u \u00feinne nextan on \u00feinre heortan ac \u00ferea hine openlice. Ne tyn \u00f0u \u00feine neahgeburas; lufa \u00feinne freond swa \u00f0e sylfne: ic eom Drihten. Healda\u00f0 mine \u00e6; ne do \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6t nytenu h\u00e6mon mid o\u00feres cynnes nytenum: ne saw \u00f0u \u00f0inne \u00e6cer mid Ne ete ge \u00fe\u00e6ra treowa bleda \u00f0e ge plantia\u00f0, \u00e6r \u00f0am",
